<h4 nodeId="f2d3a4e1bf5b44518fb2b27222ad167a">Q6：支持业务X将规则111直接共享给业务Y下的子业务Y-a，而不共享给业务Y么？</h4>
<p nodeId="2d0934da97784a5fa31c44be350b1c39">A：<km-mention name="王东" uid="wangdong13" empId="" nodeId="288f25881d5f44a08f07fac3fc02fdb8" />确认答案</p>
<h4 nodeId="624b4cef91234b69a90b1c41eaf2692a">Q7：父子业务下，静默期的时间怎么确认？</h4>
<p nodeId="4086d7db653f4dcd9604a5a336be79be">A：<km-mention name="杜方宇" uid="dufangyu" empId="" nodeId="dd99a8a49c7b433cb6680ea27426bdeb" />确认答案，什么是静默期 👉 <a href="https://km.sankuai.com/page/28163548" title="https://km.sankuai.com/page/28163548" autoUpdate="true" nodeId="b4856d85d8de47b69c3be872462cdd2e">https://km.sankuai.com/page/28163548</a></p>
<h4 nodeId="9f829aa8ca0a468da17841c6e7a11582">Q8：场景配置下的复制场景配置支持复制的范围是什么？</h4>
<p nodeId="5b286af43a834cc7b7cb5133183cb69b">A：支持父业务复制给子业务，子业务复制给父业务，不支持父业务复制给父业务</p>
